 308:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *  Function description
 309:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    Stores a formatted string in SEGGER RTT control block.
 310:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    This data is read by the host.
 311:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *
 312:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *  Parameters
 313:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used. (e.g. 0 for "Terminal")
 314:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    sFormat      Pointer to format string
 315:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    pParamList   Pointer to the list of arguments for the format string
 316:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *
 317:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *  Return values
 318:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *    >= 0:  Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Up"-buffer.
 319:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** *     < 0:  Error
 320:./SystemView/SEGGER_RTT_printf.c **** */
